*.zip
# Local TabPFN checkpoints are never committed (non-commercial weights; 200+ MB). The snapshot manifest,
# config.json, LICENSE and README.md under weights/<model-key>/ are committable; weights/model.ckpt (the
# re-serialised base checkpoint kept for the DIMER wizard upload) stays local.
weights/*.ckpt
weights/**/*.ckpt
weights/**/*.safetensors
weights/**/*.bin
weights/**/*.pt
weights/**/*.pth
weights/**/*.onnx
weights/**/.cache/
.ruff_cache/
outputs/
